                    in Sai as Tohaig 58/WHS 3064 at 2305Z. (Ibid., Box 1020, Alexander M. Haig
                    Special File, Gen. Haig’s Vietnam Trip, Tohaig 1–105, January 14–21, 1973 [1 of
                    2])</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d299-f2" n="2" xml:id="d299-f2-content">
                <p>January 20 and 21.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
